WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.740
A guide shows tourists around the old town.

2
00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:09.230
W 1990 roku zbudowano tu most.

3
00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:12.700
Who built it? We are not told.

4
00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:17.030
Most został zbudowany w 1990 roku.

5
00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:20.020
The same fact, in the passive.

6
00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:23.670
Mówi się, że to najlepsza restauracja w mieście.

7
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:27.460
What people say, without saying who.

8
00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:29.510
Tu się nie pali.

9
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.820
A general rule.

10
00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:38.890
Most został zbudowany w 1990 roku.

11
00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:44.010
Polish has several ways to leave out who does something.

12
00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:48.720
Choose by style: the passive is more formal.

13
00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:54.200
Say that smoking is not allowed here.

14
00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.100
Tu się nie pali.

15
00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:02.460
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

16
00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:05.660
Tu się nie pali.

17
00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:12.940
The bridge was built in 1990. Use the passive.

18
00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:19.120
Most został zbudowany w 1990 roku.

19
00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:23.480
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

20
00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:28.960
Most został zbudowany w 1990 roku.

21
